lden somebody who's taking over an entire sovereign country. It doesn't make sense to me. 88941-PAGS, 88941-7247, JoePAGS.com. I saw earlier on television, I saw Zelensky from Ukraine speaking to the Parliament in Canada. And Cara, I thought it'd be the dumbest thing. Did you see any video of this?",
